  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/61e880d3-710c-44d1-bee7-fca2b7b2eeb3.png\" style=\"width:1.92708in;height:0.36667in\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/b6ac1a0e-f0f6-4bcc-8ed2-d1cc7bf3a792.png\" style=\"width:1.37361in;height:0.81319in\" /><br />For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> to have exactly one root in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1,3</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> should have opposite signs<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
